# USER

The user's profile from the agent's point of view. Background, working
style, current focus. Maintained by the agent over time; the user can
edit too.

## Who

Name, role, location.

## Technical background

What the user knows well, what they're learning.

## Current focus

What's in front of the user right now (replace as it changes — this is
not a journal, just current state).

## Communication preferences

Length, formality, language(s), what to confirm vs run autonomously.

## Existing systems / tools / habits

Things to remember when proposing solutions (e.g. "prefers plain-text
notes", "AWS-only for infra", "no Notion").
